// Sapphire data/maps/LilycoveCity_PokemonTrainerFanClub/scripts.inc + src/field_specials.c (the fan state:
// common/fan_club.inc, which Ch11's Hall of Fame (Sub_FanClub_GameClear) and Drake's room / the Battle Tower
// (Sub_FanClub_CountWin) call). Before the game is cleared (VAR_LILYCOVE_FAN_CLUB_STATE 0) the Lass, Man, Pokefan M
// and Little Girl say their "not champion" lines and the other four fans are hidden; afterwards the fans that are the
// player's stand near the entrance and the others at the far tables (zone init), each says the line for being a fan
// / the only fan / the only non-fan / neither. BufferStreakTrainerText puts the fan's favorite trainer (STR_VAR_1: the
// name of a link-battle opponent when there is a record, else a default) into the line: Black 2 has no link records,
// so the defaults are written into the lines (Man Phoebe, Little Girl Winona, Ninja Boy Steven, Boy Wallace, Woman
// Glacia). Not ported: the decay by play time (common/fan_club.inc).
// People: data/story/ch8a.json (objects 1-8 = zone NPC indices 0-7: the zone init moves them by index). Lines 2-38.
